UNOFFICIAL FORK
===============
This branch (caption-v3.7) is the current upstream version of the caption
bundle by Axel Sommerfeldt (https://gitlab.com/axelsommerfeldt/caption) plus
bug fixes for upstream issues #82, #147, #171, #177, #181 and #184 (branch
fixes-combined) plus support of tagged PDF (caption v3.7, caption3 v2.5; see
CHANGELOG). It is not an official release and not on CTAN. The generated
files in tex/ are not updated; build them from source/ with "tex caption.ins".
A proof of concept for tagged-PDF support is on the branch poc-caption4
(see poc/REPORT.md there).
The original README follows.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

