Maintenance Status: maintained (by Axel Sommerfeldt)

Note:
  Although the maintenance status is still "maintained" this package
  is basically unmaintained since I will neither do bugfixes nor implement
  new features. I will just finish the new documentation and will mark
  it as "unmaintained" afterwards.
  If you want to become the maintainer of this package bundle just take it
  and drop me an e-mail so I'm informed about this, and can still
  contribute to the new documentation (if desirable).

